      ],
      "text": "4.30\t Choice of intravenous fluids for resuscitation and maintenance in",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        229.61419677734375,
        127.74569702148438,
